WEBVTT

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:04.120
Yuzu, don't leave my side.

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:06.320
Don't worry. I can protect myself.

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.200
I mean it... Stay with me!

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.760
I swear I'll keep you safe.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:15.990
Hugo?

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.500
In situations like this, Fusion Su—

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:24.900
It's not "Fusion"! It's "Hugo"!

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:30.410
Get it right!

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:33.480
Hey! Don't ride motorcycles in the halls!

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:35.750
It's not a motorcycle... It's a D-Wheel!

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:41.250
But just...

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:44.660
What is this place?!

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:51.130
Serena... Why?

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:54.830
Serena here.

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:57.440
I have Yuzu Hiiragi in custody.

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:58.310
Good.

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:01.310
Now, all the pieces are in place.

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:04.120
Yusyo Sakaki,

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:09.250
it seems the time has finally come, 
for me to tell you everything.

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:21.730
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:25.500
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:29.300
Their dragons call to each other,

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:32.540
almost as if seeking one another.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:10.970
Guardians of the Sun and Moon

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:21.890
Strange...

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:24.410
Not a single Academia soldier is here.

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:25.320
No.

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:32.100
Since Leo Akaba should already be 
aware that we're on the island...

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:33.950
A trap?

00:03:33.950 --> 00:03:35.990
Even if it is a trap...

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.760
If Ruri is still in that tower, 
we must go save her!

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:41.430
Hey!

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:45.930
Ow, ow... I give! I give!

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:47.510
You Fusion minion!

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:49.980
It's not "Fusion." It's "Hugo."

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:51.360
Hugo?

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:53.180
I see. So you're the one...

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:55.540
You hurry, too!

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:58.720
Who is that guy?

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:01.390
How did you get here before us, Hugo?

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:06.090
Yuzu's bracelet lit up and sent me here.

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:07.930
Sent you?

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:08.790
What do you mean?

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:13.550
I don't really get it, but I've been 
thrown around a bit, before.

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:15.770
So, what is this place?

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:17.740
It's Academia.

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:20.340
This is Academia?!

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:23.810
Yes, and we know where Rin is.

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:24.950
What?

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:28.120
Where is Rin?

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.780
The top floor of the beach-side tower.

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:32.880
Why didn't you say that earlier?

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:34.300
Be careful!

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:36.710
This could be an Academia trap...

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:41.370
I see speech won't reach him.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:43.900
But I suppose we should go, too.

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:45.590
Yes, sir.

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:48.520
To see Leo Akaba.

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:52.230
Rin...

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:57.920
Up there? Is she up there?

00:04:57.920 --> 00:05:01.250
Wait for me, Rin. I'm on my way.

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:10.090
Wait for me, Syun.

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:13.220
I'm going to save your 
little sister right now.

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:19.920
Serena's being manipulated.

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.670
She even took Yuzu to Academia.

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:26.610
Which means three of 
them are at Academia,

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:28.940
including Kurosaki's little sister, Ruri.

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:33.230
No. The girl Hugo's looking 
for, Rin, is also probably...

00:05:33.230 --> 00:05:38.050
Yeah. Since he came after me, 
thinking I was Joeri.

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:44.340
That means the Professor has 
all the girls he's looking for...

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:45.020
Sora,

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:48.180
do you know anything? Anything at all?

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:51.340
Why is the Professor after 
Yuzu and the others?

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:55.690
I said it before, but I don't know, either.

00:05:55.690 --> 00:05:59.690
But the Aquaria Project he's working for

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:02.850
is about uniting all four dimensions.

00:06:02.850 --> 00:06:05.980
Every dimension has a girl 
who looks just like Yuzu.

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:13.180
Which means that now, the Professor 
must have all the girls he needs.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:17.930
The world is divided into four dimensions.

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:21.950
The fact that the Professor 
was trying to collect the girl

00:06:21.950 --> 00:06:24.430
with the same face in each one

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:30.460
suggests that those four must have some 
connection to the Aquaria Project.

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:32.100
They do?

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:35.420
I see. Then if we save them,

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:38.140
we might be able to stop 
the Aquaria Project.

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:38.810
Yeah.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:42.510
So we have to save them 
as quickly as possible!

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:43.510
Yeah!

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:54.960
I am the guardian of the western tower, Diana.

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:57.430
Is Ruri in here?

00:06:58.280 --> 00:07:01.900
You cannot pass unless you beat me!

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:05.430
Then, that's just what I'll do!

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:07.000
Duel!

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:09.800
I shall go first.

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:13.620
I activate my spell card 
Polymerization from my hand!

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:18.280
I fuse Guardian Baou and 
Penumbral Soldier Lady.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:22.780
When the sword that crushes evil 
reflects the light of the Moon,

00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:24.990
the two warriors become one.

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:26.690
Fusion Summon!

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:30.070
Penumbral Keeper, descend!

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:35.250
And I activate Penumbral 
Keeper's monster effect!

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:39.040
I Special Summon one Keeper Shield Token.

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:43.510
While this token is on the field, 
attacks cannot target Penumbral Keeper.

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:47.660
Then, I set one card and end my turn.

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:56.890
Rin!

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:05.230
I am the guardian of the eastern tower, Apollo.

00:08:05.230 --> 00:08:08.780
Shut up! Afollo, Popollo, 
or whatever your name is...

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:11.200
I don't have time to deal with old men!

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:12.750
Where's Rin?

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:13.810
Give her back!

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:18.630
If you wish her back, you must defeat me.

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:21.750
Damn, I don't have time for this...

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:26.920
Then, as you wish, I'll destroy you!

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:27.820
Duel!

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:31.260
I shall go first.

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:34.540
I activate my spell card 
Polymerization from my hand!

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:39.930
I fuse Guardian Tryce and Luminous Soldier!

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:43.930
When the twin, flashing blades 
reflect the light of the Sun,

00:08:43.930 --> 00:08:46.640
the two warriors become one.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.240
Fusion Summon!

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:51.880
Luminous Keeper, descend!

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:57.340
And I activate Luminous Keeper's 
monster effect!

00:08:57.340 --> 00:09:00.950
I Special Summon one Keeper Shield Token!

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:06.350
While this token is on the field, 
attacks cannot target Penumbral Keeper.

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:10.330
Then, I set one card and end my turn.

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:11.640
Let's go!

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:13.000
My turn!

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:17.470
I activate my spell card Speedroid 
Scratch from my hand!

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:20.280
I send a Speedroid from my 
hand to the graveyard,

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:23.340
to add one Speedroid from 
my deck to my hand!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:30.600
Then, I summon the card I added to 
my hand, Speedroid Double Yoyo!

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:34.110
When I succeed in summoning this card,

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:38.140
I can Special Summon one Speedroid, 
Level 3 or below, from my graveyard.

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.830
Come out, Den-Den Daiko Duke!

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:46.550
Level 3 Den-Den Daiko Duke tunes 
Level 4 Speedroid Double Yoyo!

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.130
Synchro Summon!

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:54.770
Appear, Level 7 Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:59.080
My turn!

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:03.210
I summon Cipher Wing from my hand!

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:10.060
When there's a Cipher Wing 
on my side of the field,

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:13.340
I can Special Summon another 
Cipher Wing from my hand.

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:19.680
And I activate Continuous Spell 
Double Exposure from my hand.

00:10:20.540 --> 00:10:25.440
It doubles the level of two monsters, 
Level 6 or below, on my side of the field.

00:10:26.050 --> 00:10:30.580
And I overlay the two Cipher Wings, 
which are now Level 8!

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:35.580
Xyz Summon!

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:37.280
Descend,

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:41.530
Rank 8 Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon!

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:55.300
Already summoned your 
ace monster, have you?

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:02.820
You want to settle this quickly, 
but I'd rather have a bit more fun.

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:07.080
I activate my Continuous Trap 
Admiration of the Keepers!

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:11.820
I negate Clear Wing Synchro Dragon's effect,

00:11:12.280 --> 00:11:16.790
and Special Summon two Keeper Shield 
Tokens to my side of the field!

00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:21.490
I negate Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon's effect,

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:26.460
and Special Summon two Keeper Shield 
Tokens to my side of the field!

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:31.670
Your monster can attack all 
Keeper Shield Tokens at once.

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:36.870
But if you do not attack, 
your monster will be destroyed.

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:38.920
Well, what will you do?

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:41.980
Will you attack my Keeper Shield Tokens?

00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:42.880
Or...

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:47.850
...will you fail to attack, and lose 
your ace monster?

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:49.960
There's no need to think about it!

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:54.890
Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon attacks 
Keeper Shield Token!

00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:57.800
Annihilating Cipher Stream!

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:00.330
Battle!

00:12:00.850 --> 00:12:05.400
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon attacks 
Keeper Shield Token!

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:14.650
In that instant, Luminous Keeper's 
effect activates!

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:18.400
The attack points of a monster that 
destroys a Keeper Shield Token

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:20.110
decrease by 800.

00:12:20.110 --> 00:12:23.350
And it deals 800 points of damage to you!

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:28.300
The more of my tokens you defeat,

00:12:28.300 --> 00:12:32.830
the lower your monster's attack points 
fall, and the more life you lose.

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:35.680
Will you continue, regardless?

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:38.340
So that's your plan?

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:43.070
In that instant, Penumbral Keeper's 
effect activates!

00:12:43.730 --> 00:12:47.180
The attack points of a monster that 
destroy a Keeper Shield Token

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:48.610
decrease by 800.

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:52.380
And I recover 800 life.

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:56.570
The more of my tokens you defeat,

00:12:56.570 --> 00:13:01.290
the lower your monster's attack points 
fall, and the more life I recover.

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:04.970
Will you continue, regardless?

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:07.060
A ridiculous game...

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:12.540
If you don't want to lose any more life, 
why not end your turn right now?

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:17.740
Although if you do, you'll lose 
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon...

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:19.910
There's no way I'm doing that!

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:21.530
Battle!

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:26.780
I attack the second Keeper Shield Token 
with Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:31.720
Luminous Keeper's effect activates!

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:36.320
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon's 
attack points decrease by 800,

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:39.140
and you take 800 points of damage!

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:41.570
I attack the third one.

00:13:44.180 --> 00:13:46.500
Luminous Keeper's monster effect!

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:51.240
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon's 
attack points decrease by 800,

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:53.980
and you take 800 points of damage!

00:13:56.960 --> 00:14:02.120
No matter what you try, there is 
only one thing I must do.

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:03.100
Battle!

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:08.840
Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon attacks 
the second Keeper Shield Token!

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:13.560
Penumbral Keeper's effect activates.

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:18.040
Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon's 
attack points decrease by 800,

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:21.010
and I recover 800 life.

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:22.520
Wait for me, Syun.

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:26.380
I will save your sister, I swear!

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:31.510
Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon attacks 
the third Keeper Shield Token!

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:36.550
Penumbral Keeper's monster effect.

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:41.160
Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon's 
attack points decrease by 800,

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:44.400
and I recover 800 life.

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:55.710
To retain your ace monster, 
you've shaved down your life.

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:59.320
But it has only 100 attack points remaining.

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:01.850
Was there a point to keeping it?

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:04.150
Of course!

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:08.490
Now, Luminous Keeper has no more shields.

00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:12.170
And by taking damage during 
the Battle Phase,

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:16.360
I can Special Summon Speedroid Gum Prize!

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:22.990
And when I succeed in Special Summoning it,

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:29.960
Level 1 Speedroid Gum Prize can tune 
Level 7 Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:34.800
Let the clear wings, infused with holy power,

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:37.620
shine and strike at the enemy!

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:39.880
Synchro Summon!

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:45.590
Appear, Level 8 Crystal Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:52.630
The destruction of its target monster 
destroys Admiration of the Keepers.

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:58.620
He escaped that situation, and summoned 
an ace monster of a higher level.

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:02.540
But that won't be enough to beat me!

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:06.910
What are you saying? 
My turn's not over yet!

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:12.010
When Speedroid Gum Prize is used 
as a Synchro Summon component,

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:17.390
I draw one card from my deck. If it's a 
Speedroid, I send it to my graveyard,

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:23.090
and add its attack points to those of 
Crystal Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:25.800
I'll end it with this card.

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:28.250
Rin is right ahead.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:31.040
I have no more time to waste here!

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:33.200
Please,

00:16:33.520 --> 00:16:35.350
my cards...

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:37.640
Draw!

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:40.480
Yeah! Lucky draw!

00:16:48.160 --> 00:16:51.560
The 1000 attack points of the Ohajikid I drew

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:55.050
are added to those of Crystal 
Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:57.610
Battle!

00:16:57.610 --> 00:17:01.770
Crystal Wing Synchro Dragon 
attacks Luminous Keeper!

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:06.240
Luminous Keeper is destroyed, 
but my next turn...

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:09.770
I'm not done yet!

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:15.470
When Crystal Wing Synchro Dragon does 
battle with a monster of Level 5 or higher,

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:19.670
its attack points increase by 
those of the monster it targets!

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:23.220
6400 attack points?

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:24.790
Go!

00:17:25.670 --> 00:17:29.860
Gale Crystallos Edge!

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:46.710
Rin...

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:56.150
To retain your ace monster, 
you've restored my life points.

00:17:57.090 --> 00:18:00.170
But it has only 600 attack points remaining.

00:18:00.170 --> 00:18:02.440
Was there a point to keeping it?

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:05.100
Of course!

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:09.050
Now Penumbral Keeper has no more shields.

00:18:09.390 --> 00:18:15.420
I activate my Quick-Play Spell Rank-Up-Magic 
Cipher Pursuit from my hand!

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:19.520
When there's a 2000 or greater 
difference in our life points,

00:18:19.520 --> 00:18:25.380
I can Xyz Summon one Cipher Monster, 
one rank or higher than the targeted monster.

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:28.780
Galaxy shining in the darkness...

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:33.530
Release your eternal light 
to guide us to the future!

00:18:34.020 --> 00:18:36.390
Rank-Up Xyz Change!

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:41.470
Descend, Rank 9 Neo 
Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon!

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:46.940
The destruction of its target monster 
destroys Admiration of the Keepers.

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:52.090
Cipher Pursuit's effect allows Neo 
Galaxy-Eyes to use its effect!

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:56.680
I use all of its Overlay Units to 
activate its monster effect!

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:59.460
Cipher Super Projection!

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:06.360
I take control of as many of your monsters 
as I can, with their effects negated.

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:11.460
Monsters I take control of in this 
way cannot attack on this turn.

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:14.710
And they become Neo 
Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragons!

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:17.670
My monster...

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:23.140
I also activate my Quick-Play Spell 
Galaxy-Eyes Nova from my hand!

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:26.380
I tribute my second Neo Galaxy-Eyes,

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:31.320
to Special Summon Galaxy-Eyes Cipher 
Dragon from my graveyard!

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:41.900
I attack directly with 
Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon

00:19:41.900 --> 00:19:46.090
and Neo Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon!

00:19:57.140 --> 00:19:59.840
No... Stop it!

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:06.280
Are you ready to make your confession?

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:12.310
Annihilating Double Cipher Stream!

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:27.850
Ruri!

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:46.490
Kaito!

00:20:47.670 --> 00:20:49.080
What are you doing here?

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:51.200
Let's go. Syun's waiting for you.

00:20:53.970 --> 00:20:55.670
Okay, thank you.

00:21:04.770 --> 00:21:05.940
Rin!

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:10.650
Hugo...

00:21:11.550 --> 00:21:13.380
Rin!

00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:23.860
You're late! What took you so long?!

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:26.100
R-Rin...

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:29.380
I've been waiting... for so long.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:35.080
I was so worried, so disheartened, so afraid...

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:41.180
Hugo, you... idiot!

00:21:42.330 --> 00:21:43.260
Rin...

00:21:56.870 --> 00:22:00.280
Rin, you're okay now.

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:01.880
Yeah.

00:23:50.700 --> 00:23:53.540
I'm sorry. I was late in saving you.

00:23:53.980 --> 00:23:56.410
But I thought first, I should focus

00:23:56.410 --> 00:23:59.480
on our promise to win the Friendship Cup.

00:23:59.480 --> 00:24:02.220
I don't care about that nonsense.

00:24:02.220 --> 00:24:04.540
Right now, you must duel me.

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:09.620
Rin, have you forgotten the hard 
work we put into our D-Wheel?

00:24:10.130 --> 00:24:14.870
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Bell That Triggers the Bite.

00:24:14.870 --> 00:24:17.030
The fun is only getting started!
